#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:9
msgid "AIX support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:11
msgid "After a long wait psutil finally supports a new exotic platform: AIX!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:13
msgid ""
"Honestly I'm not sure how many AIX Python users are out there (probably not "
"many), but here it is."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:16
msgid ""
"For this we have to thank `Arnon Yaari <https://github.com/wiggin15>`__, who "
"started working on the port a couple of years ago (:gh:`605`). I was "
"skeptical at first, because AIX is the only platform I can't virtualize and "
"test on my laptop, so that made me a bit nervous. Arnon did a great job. The "
"final :pr:`1123` is huge: it required a considerable amount of work on his "
"part, and a review of more than 140 messages exchanged between us over about "
"a month, during which I was travelling through China."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:24
msgid ""
"The end result is very good: almost all original unit tests pass, and code "
"quality is awesome, which (I must say) is fairly unusual for an external "
"contribution like this. Kudos to you, Arnon! ;-)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:29
msgid "Other changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:31
msgid ""
"Besides AIX support, release 5.4.0 also includes a couple of important bug "
"fixes for :func:`psutil.sensors_temperatures` and :func:`psutil."
"sensors_fans` on Linux, and a fix for a bug on macOS that could cause a "
"segmentation fault when using :meth:`Process.open_files`. The complete list "
"of bug fixes is in the :ref:`changelog <540>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:38
msgid "The future"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:40
msgid ""
"Looking ahead at other exotic, still-unsupported platforms, two "
"contributions are worth mentioning: a (still incomplete) PR for Cygwin which "
"looks promising (:pr:`998`), and Mingw32 compiler support on Windows (:pr:"
"`845`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:44
msgid ""
"psutil is gradually reaching a point where adding new features is becoming "
"rarer, so it's a good moment to welcome new platforms while the API is "
"mature and stable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:48
msgid ""
"Future work along these lines could also include Android and (hopefully) iOS "
"support. Now *that* would be really awesome to have."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../blog/2017/aix-support.rst:51
msgid "Stay tuned."
msgstr ""

